          "end": 135,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.030:block:1",
          "start": 55
        },
        "quote": "(1) The area must contain at least one block face, and be primarily residential;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.030:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.270.030 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "f0797ad3-3877-53b3-a4cf-4ad36f965d0a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 204,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.030:block:2",
          "start": 136
        },
        "quote": "(2) A minimum of 75 percent of the area must be presently developed;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.030:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.270.030 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "9fd49490-a80d-5399-8071-fb16aea2ea17",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 352,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.030:block:3",
          "start": 205
        },
        "quote": "(3) The area must possess a unique and distinctive physical character/form that predominates from the time of its original or earliest development;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.030:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.270.030 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "3ffb8270-5aec-5d68-b148-d52eaec4cb0b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 516,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.030:block:4",
          "start": 353
        },
        "quote": "(4) The area must have a distinctive atmosphere or character that can be effectively protected by preserving or enhancing its architectural or physical attributes;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.270.030:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.270.030 block 5",
        "locator": {
